        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Don Hall, Chris Williams, Hiro Hamada, Ryan Potter, Mike Fukanaga\n- Works: Big Hero 6, Supah Ninjas\n- Roles: director, actor, voice actor, robotics prodigy, superhero team, masked villain\n\nFacts:\n- Big Hero 6 was directed by Don Hall and Chris Williams.\n- Big Hero 6 tells the story of Hiro Hamada, a young robotics prodigy who forms a superhero team to fight a masked villain.\n- Ryan Potter began his professional acting career at age 15.\n- Ryan Potter is known for starring as Mike Fukanaga in Supah Ninjas.\n- In 2014, Ryan Potter voiced Hiro Hamada in Big Hero 6.",
